  "customfield_10087": null,
  "customfield_10121": null,
  "customfield_10154": null,
  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Presently fcrepo-module-auth-webac follows ldp:contains relations in basic containers (via jcr node containment), but not other containment arrangements.  It was suggested that the WebAC specification indicates that the model should work with other containment relations, such as pcdm:hasMember via ldp:IndirectContainers.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The following test is run against the fcrepo4-vagrant vm with authentication set to true (fcrepo version 4.7.0), and shows that a policy assigned to container does not inherit to its child via indirect containment:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/bbpennel/fcrepo-webac-test"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/bbpennel/fcrepo-webac-test",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "There are some questions about the practicality of addressing this issue, particularly in multiple containment situations.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
