     "body": "<p>I'm closing this issue as part of a jira repository scrubbing.  It appears to be out of date, no longer applicable, or addressed by future versions of Fedora.</p>",
     "created": "17/Sep/21 2:37 PM",
     "id": "22345",
     "jsdPublic": true,
